        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This 3-bedroom mid-terrace property presents an excellent opportunity for those looking for a complete renovation project with plenty of potential.\nIdeally located within walking distance of Sligo town centre and just a short distance from a bus stop, the property is conveniently positioned close to a wide range of shops, services, amenities and excellent transport links.\nHaving been vacant since 2023, the property may qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, subject to meeting the relevant eligibility criteria and terms and conditions.\nHouse sold as seen. \n\nAccommodation\n\nSitting Room\n3.89m x 3.51m * Front Aspect * Open Fire\n\nKitchen/Dining Area\n5.45m x 3.00m * Double Back Aspect * Door to Back Garden\n\nBedroom 1\n3.00m x 3.90m * Front Aspect * Laminate Floor\n\nBedroom 2\n2.34m x 2.95m * Front Aspect * Laminate Floor\n\nBedroom 3\n3.35m x 2.81m * Back Aspect * Laminate Floor * Built in Wardrobe\n\nBathroom\n2.00m x 1.70m * Shower / WC * No Hand Basin * Walls Partially Tiled\n\nEntrance Hall\n3.80m x 1.70m * Storage Space\n\nEntrance\n5.20m x 5.80m Front Garden\n\nRear\n9.00m x 5.50m Back Garden\n\n"
